    exfalso; lia.
  - exact fm12_1RB1LA_1LC0RD_0RB0LC_0LA1RD.
  - repeat constructor.
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - lia.
  - lia.
  - exact iarm_reach_1RB1LA_1LC0RD_0RB0LC_0LA1RD.
  - exact iarm_lhs_1RB1LA_1LC0RD_0RB0LC_0LA1RD.
